{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomali Dedektifi</strong> seni bir polis memurunun yerine koyuyor. Bir gece al\u0131nan acil bir ihbar sonras\u0131 olay yerine intikal ediyorsun. Ancak s\u0131radan g\u00f6r\u00fcnen yard\u0131m \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131, seni gizemli bir tarikat\u0131n ve \u00e7a\u011f\u0131r\u0131lmakta olan karanl\u0131k bir iblisin g\u00f6lgesine s\u00fcr\u00fckl\u00fcyor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ger\u00e7eklik s\u00fcrekli kay\u0131yor, \u00e7evrende her an bir \u015feyler de\u011fi\u015fiyor. G\u00f6zlem g\u00fcc\u00fcn ve dikkat seviyen tek silah\u0131n. Yanl\u0131\u015f bir ad\u0131m ya da ka\u00e7\u0131r\u0131lan bir anomali seni \u00f6l\u00fcmc\u00fcl sonu\u00e7lara s\u00fcr\u00fckleyebilir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >G\u00f6revin:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Olay\u0131 ara\u015ft\u0131rmak</strong> \u2013 \u0130hbar\u0131n ard\u0131ndaki ger\u00e7e\u011fi ortaya \u00e7\u0131kar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomalileri tespit etmek</strong> \u2013 \u00c7evrende meydana gelen do\u011fa\u00fcst\u00fc de\u011fi\u015fiklikleri fark et.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raporlamak</strong> \u2013 Her bulguyu dikkatle kaydet, aksi takdirde hatalar\u0131n seni iblisin oyununa \u00e7eker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hayatta kalmak</strong> \u2013 Tarikat\u0131n g\u00f6lgesinde zihnini ve bedenini koru.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Karanl\u0131k, sessizlik ve bilinmezlik\u2026 Hepsi tek bir soruda birle\u015fiyor:<br><strong>Ger\u00e7ekli\u011fi koruyabilecek misin?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973710?t=1757537040","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973710/74d45fddc1a40c0a62e32078887a600819d77c05/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757537040","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a